# (1.4.0, the user's) the knobs without their numbers: a ring's number shown a moment as a page opens (the peek), then
# gone (the ring says it; the big ring gives it while a knob turns); Values: Peek or Always (global, saved, as Lights),
# on Setup's KNOB 4 (the user's, 2026-11-22: from the Set page, where Load is now)
listen
wait 1500
expect values 0
tap ENV
wait 200
expect peek 1
wait 2000
expect peek 0
tap ENV
wait 200
expect peek 1
wait 2000
expect peek 0
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 6
said Setup page: Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On, Values Peek
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Values Always
expect values 1
expect peek 1
tap ENV
wait 2500
expect peek 1
# kept by a save, a reboot
press GLO
wait 600
release GLO
reboot
wait 1000
expect values 1
expect peek 1
tap GLO
wait 400
expect view 6
spin K4 -1
wait 300
said Values Peek
expect values 0
tap ENV
wait 2500
expect peek 0
